# q opens Quick Add on the project tagged @inbox; Enter adds the task as its last child and names it.
file <<END
INBOX: @inbox
	- Old item
Work:
	- Email boss
END
keys q
see Quick Add → INBOX
type Call mom
keys <Enter>
status Added to INBOX
quit
saved <<END
INBOX: @inbox
	- Old item
	- Call mom
Work:
	- Email boss
END
